  <pre class='code-block__pre'><code class='code-block__code'>{
  "id": "evt_8f2c1a90",
  "type": "order.created",
  "occurred_at": "2026-08-18T09:12:44Z",
  "source": "connector_postgres_orders",
  "payload": { "order_id": "ord_4471", "amount_cents": 4899 }
}</code></pre>
</div>

<p>Every event contains two distinct layers:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>The envelope</strong> — top-level metadata managed by Godzilla (<code>id</code>, <code>type</code>, <code>occurred_at</code>, <code>source</code>).</li>
